# {{lb|en|computing}} A series of [[bit]]s that represents a [[rasterize]]d [[graphic]] [[image]], each [[pixel]] being represented as a group of bits.
#: {{synonyms|en|pixmap|raster}}
#: {{coordinate terms|en|vector}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2002|author=André LaMothe|title=Tricks of the Windows Game Programming Gurus|page=315|passage=Using the hardware blitter to move '''bitmaps''' from VRAM to VRAM is much faster than moving them from system memory to VRAM.}}

